---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WhatsAppCTA from '../../../components/conversion/WhatsAppCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Street Lighting & Public Safety · Precinct 4 Issue"
  description="Lupe Negrete's plan for functional street lighting and increased Sheriff patrols in Precinct 4, Maverick County, Texas."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white py-14 md:py-20 border-b-4 border-navy-700">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4">
      <a href="/en/issues/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        ← Back to all issues
      </a>
      <div class="inline-block bg-navy-800 border border-navy-700 text-amber-400 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Key Issue · Safety & Services
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-heading text-white leading-tight">
        Well-Lit Streets and Safe Families
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg">
        Functional lighting on every residential block and full support for the Maverick County Sheriff’s Office.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- AI-optimized summary answer -->
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border-l-8 border-navy-900 border-y border-r border-slate-200 shadow-md space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        What does Lupe Negrete propose for street lighting and neighborhood safety?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Lupe Negrete will champion an emergency LED lighting overhaul program across Precinct 4 colonias, combined with increased budget allocations for equipment, patrols, and faster response times for the Maverick County Sheriff’s Office.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Local Problem -->
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-800 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">Dark Streets and Inadequate Patrols</h2>
      <p>
        Walking home from school bus stops or returning late from work should never put our residents at risk. Currently, dozens of street lights across Precinct 4 remain dark for months without proper county service.
      </p>
      <p>
        Darkness creates blind spots that invite criminal activity and increases traffic hazards. The safety of our families starts with bright street lights and active law enforcement visibility.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Photo on site -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
      <img
        src="/images/candidate-listening.png"
        alt="Lupe Negrete listening to residents discussing public safety"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-200 text-center">
        Lupe Negrete speaking with Precinct 4 residents regarding broken street lights and patrol needs.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commitments -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">Public Safety and Service Commitments</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-100 text-navy-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Comprehensive Audit and Rapid Repair of Street Lights</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Immediate replacement with high-efficiency, energy-saving LED luminaires in residential zones.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-100 text-navy-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Expanded Sheriff Patrols and Equipment</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Ensuring the Sheriff’s Office has the necessary vehicles and staffing for continuous presence in outlying colonias.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-navy-100 text-navy-900 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Brush Clearing and Bulk Trash Removal</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Continuous county programs to clear overgrown lots and illegal dumping that compromise neighborhood safety.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contextual WhatsApp Action -->
    <div class="bg-navy-900 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl text-center space-y-6 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-heading text-white">
        Are street lights out on your block?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Send us your street intersection on WhatsApp so we can include it in our priority tracking report.
      </p>
      <div>
        <WhatsAppCTA
          source="alumbrado"
          lang="en"
          label="Report broken light on WhatsApp"
          variant="primary"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
      <a href="/en/issues/paving/" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-navy-900">
        ← Previous: Road Paving
      </a>
      <a href="/en/issues/audit/" class="text-navy-900 hover:text-red-cta flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Next: County Budget Audit</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>
